            "review_title": "Review at Knock Knock Coffee & Live Music",
            "review_text": "KnockKnockVN\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nGreat Live music Venue\nMar 2023 • Couples\nGreat Place for live music away from district 1 and the prices are reasonable for a live music bar. We did not try the coffee shop but will be back during the day to try as my wife spotted a few things she liked in the vintage shop. Nice mix of the retail space. Upstairs vibe very different to the elegant downstairs coffee shop.\nValue\nService\nWritten March 30, 2023",
